//AMULET OF PROTECTION +1 - 3000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/AMUL14.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Amulet"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Amulets are usually magical devices that are commonly worn around the neck, suspended from a chain. The type of chain that comes with an amulet generally increases the item's aesthetic value, not its magical properties. Only one amulet can be dangled from the neck at a time.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1"

	SAY NAME2 "Amulet of Protection +1"
	SAY DESC "This amulet improves the wearer's Armor Class and Saving Throws versus all forms of attack. The magical properties of the amulet prevent it from being worn with other magical items of protection like rings and cloaks.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +1
– Saving Throws: +1

Weight: 1"




