	SAY NAME1 "Amulet"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Amulets are usually magical devices that are commonly worn around the neck, suspended from a chain. The type of chain that comes with an amulet generally increases the item's aesthetic value, not its magical properties. Only one amulet can be dangled from the neck at a time.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1"


	SAY NAME2 "Rainbow Amulet"
	SAY DESC "The story goes that Evander Delight, an extravagant gold prospector from Sembia, followed every rainbow, convinced he would find the legendary pot of gold. He never reached the end of any rainbow and, of course, never found any gold. However, during his travels, he found an amulet next to the corpse of an old gypsy woman. Since then, he became one of the richest men in the region, and no one dared mock him

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Save vs. Breath: +2
– Luck +1

Weight: 1"







//GREENSTONE AMULET - 6000mo//
