	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Amulets are usually magical devices that are commonly worn around the neck, suspended from a chain. The type of chain that comes with an amulet generally increases the item's aesthetic value, not its magical properties. Only one amulet can be dangled from the neck at a time.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1"


	SAY NAME2 "Greenstone Amulet"
	SAY DESC "This heavy gold setting holds a pulsing emerald greenstone. When activated, the gem releases a cold psychic static that encases the wearer's mind like an iron fortress, instantly devouring mental assaults, dominance, and terrifying illusionary whispers. It acts as an impenetrable shield against madness and manipulation, protecting the soul from being shattered or controlled by external forces.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Immunity to charm, confusion, fear, domination, ESP, Detect Alignment, hold, stun, psionics, sleep, and feeblemind once per day
  Duration: 1 turn

Weight: 1"








//AMULET OF WHISPERS - 10000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDAMUL01.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Amulet"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Amulets are usually magical devices that are commonly worn around the neck, suspended from a chain. The type of chain that comes with an amulet generally increases the item's aesthetic value, not its magical properties. Only one amulet can be dangled from the neck at a time.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1"


	SAY NAME2 "Amulet of Whispers"
	SAY DESC "The archmage Ulcaster enjoyed making long speeches in front of his students, filibustering on any number of subjects from arcane theory to the ethics of conjuration. Most of his students enjoyed the lectures, but one of his pupils decided that he would personally stand up to interrupt the stream of words from Ulcaster's mouth.

At the next lecture, the pupil stood up and shouted, 'I won't listen to you any longer!' To his horror, no sound issued from his throat. Ulcaster had twisted the chain of an amulet he wore, which rendered every student in the lecture hall utterly silent. The archmage was unaffected, and so carried on his lecture uninhibited.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Vocalize

Charge abilities:
– Power Word Silence once per day

Weight: 1"






