	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Amulets are usually magical devices that are commonly worn around the neck, suspended from a chain. The type of chain that comes with an amulet generally increases the item's aesthetic value, not its magical properties. Only one amulet can be dangled from the neck at a time.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1"

	SAY NAME2 "Archer Eye"
	SAY DESC "This silver pendant, shaped like a wolf howling at the moon, once belonged to Christopher, a legendary Ranger of the Tethir Forest. Tales claim Christopher could pierce an apple from a mile away, even in the pitch-black darkness of a moonless night. Infused with the blessing of the wild, the amulet guides the wearer's hand, seamlessly aligning the trajectory of arrows and bolts toward the vital points of their prey. Only a true warden of the woods can attune to its magic; in the hands of anyone else, the central stone remains dull and weightless.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Chance to score a critical hit: +5% (only with ranged weapons)
– Dexterity: +1

Weight: 1"




