	SAY DESC "Forged from a pristine, translucent crystal that catches the light, this white gold amulet responds only to absolute conviction, caring nothing for the morals of its master. It amplifies the inner power of any priest who wears it. In the hands of a peaceful healer, it glows with a warm, brilliant light to repel the restless dead. In the grasp of a dark champion, its pale surface shifts into an icy, spectral glare to bend the unliving to their will, filling both with unwavering divine favor.

