	SAY DESC "This ancient amulet is crafted from a petrified seed of the first Great Oak, encased in a delicate web of living, indestructible roots. Blessed by Rillifane Rallathil and Silvanus, the amulet pulses with the pure, untamed heartbeat of nature. It rejects all who do not share a deep connection with the wilderness, functioning only for true protectors of the balance. When worn by a druid, it shields their body with a bark-like aura of protection and channels the raw energy of the earth, expanding their spiritual vessel to grant deeper access to divine magic.

