	SAY NAME2 "Guildmaster's Amulet"
	SAY DESC "This exquisite, dark-silver medallion is given only to those who reach the absolute pinnacle of the thieves' guild hierarchy—the Guildmasters and Master Thieves. Imbued with powerful illusion and abjuration magic, the amulet acts as an extension of the rogue's own honed senses. It grants the wearer uncanny reflexes to avoid strikes, sharpens their hands for complex locks, and heightens their awareness of deadly traps. Most importantly, it completely severs the wearer from the sensory world when they slip into the shadows, leaving absolute silence that even the most powerful divination magic cannot pierce.
 
